{"id": "tZzLtE-My0yg", "owner": "showcase", "title": "NEON FROG — $NFROG on Robinhood Chain", "createdAt": 1790349205515, "updatedAt": 1790349389606, "versions": [{"prompt": "Launch page for a meme token \"NEON FROG\" on Robinhood Chain — huge glowing pixel-art frog made of SVG squares, countdown, tokenomics cards, how-to-buy steps. Visual theme (follow strictly): near-black background (#050b09), neon green #39ff14 and electric blue #5bd1ff as the ONLY accent colors, subtle pixel-grid / scanline texture, glowing edges and soft neon bloom, bold grotesk headings with monospace details, futuristic cyber-crypto aesthetic. Desktop 1440px wide, fill the first screen with the hero.", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>NEON FROG — $NFROG on Robinhood Chain</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root{\n  --bg:#050b09;\n  --bg2:#07110d;\n  --green:#39ff14;\n  --blue:#5bd1ff;\n  --ink:#050b09;\n  --txt:#cfe9dc;\n  --dim:#7f9b8d;\n  --line:rgba(57,255,20,.18);\n  --max:1240px;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0}\nhtml{scroll-behavior:smooth}\nbody{\n  background:var(--bg);\n  color:var(--txt);\n  font-family:'Space Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;\n  overflow-x:hidden;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n}\n/* pixel grid + bloom background */\nbody::before{\n  content:\"\";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;\n  background-image:\n    linear-gradient(rgba(57,255,20,.055) 1px, transparent 1px),\n    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(57,255,20,.055) 1px, transparent 1px),\n    radial-gradient(900px 600px at 78% 12%, rgba(57,255,20,.13), transparent 62%),\n    radial-gradient(700px 520px at 8% 82%, rgba(91,209,255,.11), transparent 65%);\n  background-size:36px 36px,36px 36px,100% 100%,100% 100%;\n}\n/* scanlines */\nbody::after{\n  content:\"\";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:999;pointer-events:none;\n  background:repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0 2px, rgba(0,0,0,.34) 2px 4px);\n  opacity:.5;\n}\n.wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;position:relative;z-index:2}\na{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n.mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace}\n\n/* ---------- header ---------- */\nheader{\n  position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;\n  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(5,11,9,.92),rgba(5,11,9,.55));\n  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);\n}\n.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:72px}\n.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:14px;text-transform:uppercase}\n.brand .chip{width:26px;height:26px;display:block}\n.navlinks{display:flex;gap:30px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}\n.navlinks a:hover{color:var(--green);text-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(57,255,20,.7)}\n.btn{\n  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;justify-content:center;\n  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;\n  padding:13px 22px;border:1px solid var(--green);color:var(--green);\n  background:rgba(57,255,20,.06);border-radius:2px;cursor:pointer;\n  transition:.22s ease;position:relative\n}\n.btn:hover{background:var(--green);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 0 28px rgba(57,255,20,.55),0 0 80px rgba(57,255,20,.22)}\n.btn.blue{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue);background:rgba(91,209,255,.06)}\n.btn.blue:hover{background:var(--blue);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 0 28px rgba(91,209,255,.5)}\n.btn.solid{background:var(--green);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 0 26px rgba(57,255,20,.35)}\n.btn.solid:hover{box-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(57,255,20,.75)}\n.nav .btn{padding:11px 18px}\n.burger{display:none}\n\n/* ---------- hero ---------- */\n.hero{min-height:100vh;min-height:100svh;padding:120px 0 40px;display:flex;align-items:center;position:relative}\n.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.02fr .98fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;width:100%}\n.tagline{\n  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\n  font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);\n  border:1px solid rgba(91,209,255,.35);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(91,209,255,.05)\n}\n.dot{width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--green);animation:pulse 1.4s infinite}\n@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.25}}\nh1{\n  font-size:clamp(56px,8.3vw,124px);line-height:.86;margin:24px 0 0;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.035em;\n  text-transform:uppercase;color:#eafff2;\n}\nh1 .glow{color:var(--green);text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(57,255,20,.75),0 0 60px rgba(57,255,20,.35);display:block}\n.lede{max-width:520px;margin:26px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--dim)}\n.lede b{color:var(--txt);font-weight:500}\n.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:32px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.contract{\n  margin-top:26px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;\n  border:1px dashed var(--line);padding:12px 14px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(57,255,20,.03);max-width:560px\n}\n.contract span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase}\n.contract code{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--blue);word-break:break-all}\n.copy{margin-left:auto;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;background:none;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n.copy:hover{background:rgba(57,255,20,.12)}\n\n/* frog stage */\n.stage{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n.stage::before{\n  content:\"\";position:absolute;width:86%;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:50%;\n  background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(57,255,20,.30), rgba(57,255,20,.08) 45%, transparent 68%);\n  filter:blur(24px);animation:breathe 6s ease-in-out infinite\n}\n@keyframes breathe{0%,100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:.85}50%{transform:scale(1.07);opacity:1}}\n#frog{width:100%;max-width:520px;position:relative;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 22px rgba(57,255,20,.35));animation:float 7s ease-in-out infinite}\n@keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-16px)}}\n.stage-frame{\n  position:absolute;inset:auto;width:min(520px,100%);aspect-ratio:1;border:1px solid var(--line);\n  border-radius:3px;\n}\n.stage-frame::before,.stage-frame::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:14px;height:14px;border:2px solid var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(57,255,20,.6)}\n.stage-frame::before{top:-2px;left:-2px;border-right:0;border-bottom:0}\n.stage-frame::after{bottom:-2px;right:-2px;border-left:0;border-top:0}\n.stage-tag{position:absolute;bottom:-26px;left:0;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.24em;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase}\n\n/* countdown */\n.count{margin-top:34px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:24px}\n.count h3{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);font-weight:500;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n.clock{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px;max-width:470px}\n.cell{border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(57,255,20,.07),rgba(57,255,20,0));padding:14px 8px;text-align:center;border-radius:2px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.cell::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:50%;height:1px;background:rgba(5,11,9,.85)}\n.cell .num{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);color:var(--green);text-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(57,255,20,.6);line-height:1}\n.cell .lab{margin-top:8px;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n\n/* marquee */\n.marquee{border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(57,255,20,.04);overflow:hidden;position:relative;z-index:2}\n.marquee .track{display:flex;gap:44px;white-space:nowrap;padding:14px 0;animation:slide 26s linear infinite;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green)}\n.marquee .track span{opacity:.85}\n.marquee .track span em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}\n@keyframes slide{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}\n\n/* sections */\nsection{padding:110px 0;position:relative;z-index:2}\n.eyebrow{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\n.eyebrow::before{content:\"\";width:28px;height:1px;background:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--blue)}\nh2{font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,60px);line-height:.95;margin:18px 0 0;letter-spacing:-.03em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#eafff2;font-weight:700}\nh2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--green);text-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(57,255,20,.5)}\n.sec-head{max-width:720px;margin-bottom:56px}\n.sec-head p{color:var(--dim);font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:18px;max-width:560px}\n\n/* stats strip */\n.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line)}\n.stat{background:var(--bg2);padding:28px 24px}\n.stat .k{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:clamp(20px,2.4vw,28px);color:var(--green);font-weight:700;text-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(57,255,20,.35)}\n.stat .v{margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n\n/* tokenomics */\n.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}\n.card{\n  border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(57,255,20,.055),rgba(5,11,9,.4));\n  padding:26px 22px 24px;border-radius:3px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:.25s ease\n}\n.card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:rgba(57,255,20,.5);box-shadow:0 18px 60px -22px rgba(57,255,20,.5)}\n.card .idx{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.24em;color:var(--dim)}\n.card .pct{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:46px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;margin:18px 0 6px;color:var(--green);text-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(57,255,20,.45)}\n.card.b .pct{color:var(--blue);text-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(91,209,255,.45)}\n.card h4{margin:0;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.02em;color:#eafff2;text-transform:uppercase}\n.card p{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--dim)}\n.bar{margin-top:20px;height:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.bar i{position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--green) 0 6px,transparent 6px 8px);box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(57,255,20,.5);width:0;transition:width 1.2s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}\n.card.b .bar i{background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue) 0 6px,transparent 6px 8px);box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(91,209,255,.5)}\n\n/* how to buy */\n.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;border:1px solid var(--line)}\n.step{padding:34px 26px 38px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;background:rgba(7,17,13,.5);transition:.25s}\n.step:last-child{border-right:0}\n.step:hover{background:rgba(57,255,20,.06)}\n.step .n{\n  width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid var(--green);color:var(--green);\n  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(57,255,20,.28) inset,0 0 18px rgba(57,255,20,.2)\n}\n.step h4{margin:22px 0 0;font-size:19px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#eafff2}\n.step p{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--dim)}\n.step .tip{margin-top:16px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--blue);text-transform:uppercase}\n\n/* roadmap */\n.road{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}\n.phase{border-top:2px solid var(--line);padding-top:22px}\n.phase.live{border-top-color:var(--green);box-shadow:0 -1px 22px -4px rgba(57,255,20,.6)}\n.phase .tag{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}\n.phase.live .tag{color:var(--green)}\n.phase h4{margin:12px 0 14px;font-size:20px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#eafff2}\n.phase ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}\n.phase li{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--dim);line-height:1.5;padding:7px 0 7px 18px;position:relative;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(57,255,20,.1)}\n.phase li::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:14px;width:6px;height:6px;background:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--blue)}\n.phase.live li::before{background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--green)}\n\n/* cta band */\n.band{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:64px 48px;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(600px 300px at 50% 0%,rgba(57,255,20,.12),transparent 70%)}\n.band h2{margin-bottom:0}\n.band p{color:var(--dim);max-width:520px;margin:20px auto 0;line-height:1.7}\n.band .hero-cta{justify-content:center}\n\n/* faq */\n.faq{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\ndetails{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px 4px}\nsummary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center;font-size:18px;color:#eafff2;font-weight:500}\nsummary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\nsummary::after{content:\"+\";color:var(--green);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:22px}\ndetails[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\ndetails p{margin:14px 0 0;color:var(--dim);line-height:1.7;font-size:14.5px;max-width:760px}\n\nfooter{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:56px 0 40px;position:relative;z-index:2}\n.foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start}\n.foot .mono{font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--dim);line-height:2;text-transform:uppercase}\n.foot a:hover{color:var(--green)}\n.disc{margin-top:38px;font-size:11.5px;color:#4f685d;line-height:1.8;max-width:900px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n\n.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}\n.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}\n\n@media (max-width:1040px){\n  .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:48px}\n  .stage{order:-1}\n  .cards,.steps,.road,.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}\n  .steps .step{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n  .steps .step:nth-child(2n){border-right:0}\n}\n@media (max-width:720px){\n  .navlinks,.nav .btn{display:none}\n  .burger{display:block;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--green);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:9px 14px;background:none}\n  section{padding:76px 0}\n  .cards,.steps,.road,.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  .steps .step{border-right:0}\n  .clock{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:6px}\n  .band{padding:44px 22px}\n  .hero{padding-top:100px}\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!--tr-cover-->\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue:wght@400;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n.trc{--a:#8dff3a;position:relative;z-index:1000;height:100vh;min-height:620px;overflow:hidden;background:#000;color:#fff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;isolation:isolate}\n.trc-s{position:absolute;inset:-4%;background-size:cover;background-position:center;opacity:0;transition:opacity 1.4s ease;animation:trcKen 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate}\n.trc-s.on{opacity:1}\n@keyframes trcKen{from{transform:scale(1) translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:scale(1.09) translate3d(-1.5%,-1%,0)}}\n.trc::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.55) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 22%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 48%,rgba(0,0,0,.82) 100%)}\n.trc-nav{position:absolute;z-index:3;top:18px;left:24px;right:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;padding:10px 12px 10px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(10,10,12,.42);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}\n.trc-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.01em;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-logo i{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 22px var(--a);display:grid;place-items:center;font-style:normal;color:#000;font-size:13px;font-weight:900}\n.trc-links{display:flex;gap:22px;flex:1}\n.trc-links a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);text-decoration:none;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500}\n.trc-links a:hover{color:#fff}\n.trc-btn{height:38px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#fff;font:600 13px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-btn.pri{background:var(--a);border-color:var(--a);color:#000;box-shadow:0 8px 28px -8px var(--a)}\n.trc-copy{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:48px;right:48px;bottom:56px;max-width:880px}\n.trc-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.trc-chip b{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--a)}\n.trc h1{font-family:\"Bebas Neue\",Inter,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(44px,9vw,150px);line-height:.9;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:18px 0 14px;text-shadow:0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}\n.trc h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--a)}\n.trc p{font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.45;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);max-width:560px;margin:0 0 24px}\n.trc-ctas{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.trc-ctas .trc-btn{height:48px;padding:0 22px;font-size:14.5px;border-radius:12px}\n.trc-dots{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:48px;bottom:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:600 12px Inter,sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75)}\n.trc-dots i{width:22px;height:3px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);transition:.4s}\n.trc-dots i.on{width:44px;background:var(--a)}\n.trc-dots span{margin-left:8px;letter-spacing:.08em}\n@media(max-width:760px){.trc-links{display:none}.trc-nav{left:12px;right:12px;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between}.trc-nav .trc-btn:not(.pri){display:none}.trc-copy{left:20px;right:20px;bottom:40px}.trc-dots{display:none}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"trc\" data-trc=\"launch\">\n  <div class=\"trc-s on\" style=\"background-image:url(/img/cover/hydra.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"trc-s\" style=\"background-image:url(/img/cover/onlook.jpg)\"></div>\n  <nav class=\"trc-nav\"><div class=\"trc-logo\"><i>N</i>NEON FROG</div><div class=\"trc-links\"><a href=\"#\">Story</a><a href=\"#\">Tokenomics</a><a href=\"#\">How to buy</a><a href=\"#\">Community</a></div><button class=\"trc-btn\">Sign in</button><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Buy $NFROG</button></nav>\n  <div class=\"trc-copy\"><span class=\"trc-chip\"><b></b>Meme token · Robinhood Chain</span><h1>NEON <em>FROG</em></h1><p>Spiked, radioactive and unstoppable. The loudest frog on Robinhood Chain.</p>\n    <div class=\"trc-ctas\"><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Buy $NFROG</button><button class=\"trc-btn\">Learn more</button></div></div>\n  <div class=\"trc-dots\"><i class=on></i><i></i><span>01 / 02</span></div>\n</sectio