EVM wallet and add the Robinhood Chain network. The frog only lives here.</p><div class=\"tip\">Chain ID · RHC-Mainnet</div></div>\n      <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"n\">02</div><h4>Fund with RHC</h4><p>Bridge or buy the native gas token. Keep a little spare for the swap and for future hops.</p><div class=\"tip\">Leave ~2 RHC for gas</div></div>\n      <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"n\">03</div><h4>Swap for NFROG</h4><p>Open the DEX, paste the contract address above, set slippage to 1% and confirm the trade.</p><div class=\"tip\">Slippage 1% · 0% tax</div></div>\n      <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"n\">04</div><h4>Croak loudly</h4><p>Import the token, screenshot the bag, and join 40,000 amphibians in the Neon Pond chat.</p><div class=\"tip\">Ribbit responsibly</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"roadmap\" style=\"padding-top:20px\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head reveal\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">04 — Trajectory</div>\n      <h2>The <em>lilypad</em> roadmap</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"road reveal\">\n      <div class=\"phase live\"><div class=\"tag\">Phase 01 · Live now</div><h4>Spawn</h4><ul><li>Contract deployed &amp; verified</li><li>Website + pixel identity</li><li>10k wallets whitelisted</li><li>Community pond opens</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"phase\"><div class=\"tag\">Phase 02 · Launch day</div><h4>Leap</h4><ul><li>Liquidity added &amp; burned</li><li>Ownership renounced</li><li>Airdrop claim portal</li><li>Chart trackers listed</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"phase\"><div class=\"tag\">Phase 03 · Q+1</div><h4>Glow</h4><ul><li>Neon Pond staking</li><li>Pixel-frog PFP generator</li><li>CEX tier-2 listings</li><li>First meme bounty season</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"phase\"><div class=\"tag\">Phase 04 · Later</div><h4>Ascend</h4><ul><li>On-chain frog arcade</li><li>Merch drop: glow edition</li><li>Cross-chain bridge</li><li>World domination (amphibian)</li></ul></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"padding-top:20px\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"band reveal\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center\">05 — Final call</div>\n      <h2>Don't be the <em>last frog</em> in</h2>\n      <p>Liquidity is locked and burned the second the countdown hits zero. After that there is no button left to press — only the pond.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-cta\"><a class=\"btn solid\" href=\"#top\">▸ Buy $NFROG</a><a class=\"btn blue\" href=\"#faq\">Read the FAQ</a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"faq\" style=\"padding-top:20px\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head reveal\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">06 — Questions</div>\n      <h2>Frequently <em>croaked</em></h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"faq reveal\">\n      <details open><summary>Is $NFROG actually useful?</summary><p>It is a meme token. Its utility is being a very green frog on Robinhood Chain, a staking pond, and a community that makes pixel art at 3am. Nothing here is a promise of return.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>Why Robinhood Chain?</summary><p>Cheap gas, fast finality and an audience that already understands tickers. The frog goes where the people are.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>Can the team rug?</summary><p>Liquidity tokens are burned at launch and ownership is renounced, so the contract cannot be modified, minted or paused afterwards. Verify both transactions yourself before buying.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>How do I claim the airdrop?</summary><p>The claim portal opens 24 hours after trading goes live. Connect the same wallet you used for the whitelist and sign a free message — never send tokens to claim anything.</p></details>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"foot\">\n      <div>\n        <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\" style=\"font-size:18px\">\n          <svg class=\"chip\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g fill=\"#39ff14\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"0\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"0\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"2\" width=\"10\" height=\"4\"/><rect x=\"1\" y=\"6\" width=\"8\" height=\"2\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"8\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\"/></g><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#050b09\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"3\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#050b09\"/></svg>\n          Neon Frog\n        </a>\n        <div class=\"mono\" style=\"margin-top:14px;max-width:320px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:.06em\">$NFROG · Robinhood Chain · fair launch, zero tax, one billion pixels.</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mono\"><a href=\"#tokenomics\">Tokenomics</a><br><a href=\"#buy\">How to buy</a><br><a href=\"#roadmap\">Roadmap</a><br><a href=\"#faq\">FAQ</a></div>\n      <div class=\"mono\"><a href=\"#top\">Telegram pond</a><br><a href=\"#top\">X / Twitter</a><br><a href=\"#top\">Explorer</a><br><a href=\"#top\">Audit report</a></div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"disc\">DISCLAIMER: $NFROG is a community meme token with no intrinsic value, no roadmap guarantees and no expectation of financial return. Crypto assets are volatile and you may lose everything you put in. Always verify the contract address from official channels. Nothing on this page is financial advice. Frogs cannot give financial advice.</p>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n<script>\n/* ---------- pixel frog ---------- */\n(function(){\n  const g=x=>\"G\".repeat(x), s=x=>\"g\".repeat(x), d=x=>\".\".repeat(x), k=x=>\"K\".repeat(x);\n  const MAP=[\n    d(6)+g(4)+d(4)+g(4)+d(6),\n    d(5)+\"GBWWWG\"+d(2)+\"GBWWWG\"+d(5),\n    d(5)+\"GWKKWG\"+d(2)+\"GWKKWG\"+d(5),\n    d(5)+\"GWWWWG\"+d(2)+\"GWWWWG\"+d(5),\n    d(4)+\"G\"+s(14)+\"G\"+d(4),\n    d(3)+\"G\"+s(16)+\"G\"+d(3),\n    d(2)+\"G\"+s(4)+\"B\"+s(8)+\"B\"+s(4)+\"G\"+d(2),\n    d(2)+\"G\"+s(18)+\"G\"+d(2),\n    d(2)+\"GG\"+k(6)+\"BBBB\"+k(6)+\"GG\"+d(2),\n    d(2)+\"G\"+s(18)+\"G\"+d(2),\n    d(3)+\"G\"+s(6)+\"B\"+s(2)+\"B\"+s(6)+\"G\"+d(3),\n    d(4)+\"G\"+s(14)+\"G\"+d(4),\n    \"GG\"+d(2)+\"G\"+s(14)+\"G\"+d(2)+\"GG\",\n    g(4)+d(3)+g(10)+d(3)+g(4),\n    g(4)+d(16)+g(4),\n    \"GG.G\"+d(16)+\"G.GG\"\n  ];\n  const C={G:[\"#39ff14\",.95],g:[\"#39ff14\",.42],B:[\"#5bd1ff\",.95],W:[\"#eafff2\",.92],K:[\"#050b09\",1]};\n  const S=10;\n  let out='<defs><filter id=\"bloom\" x=\"-30%\" y=\"-30%\" width=\"160%\" height=\"160%\">'+\n    '<feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"2.4\" result=\"b\"/><feMerge><feMergeNode in=\"b\"/><feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"/></feMerge></filter></defs>';\n  out+='<g filter=\"url(#bloom)\">';\n  MAP.forEach((row,y)=>{\n    for(let x=0;x<row.length;x++){\n      const c=row[x]; if(c===\".\"||!C[c])continue;\n      const [col,op]=C[c];\n      out+='<rect x=\"'+(x*S)+'\" y=\"'+(y*S)+'\" width=\"'+(S-0.6)+'\" height=\"'+(S-0.6)+'\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"'+col+'\" opacity=\"'+op+'\"/>';\n    }\n  });\n  out+='<rect class=\"lid\" x=\"50\" y=\"10\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#39ff14\" opacity=\"0\"/>';\n  out+='<rect class=\"lid\" x=\"130\" y=\"10\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#39ff14\" opacity=\"0\"/>';\n  out+='</g>';\n  const svg=document.getElementById('frog');\n  svg.innerHTML=out;\n  const lids=svg.querySelectorAll('.lid');\n  function blink(){\n    lids.forEach(l=>l.setAttribute('opacity','.85'));\n    setTimeout(()=>lids.forEach(l=>l.setAttribute('opacity','0')),120);\n    setTimeout(blink,2600+Math.random()*4200);\n  }\n  setTimeout(blink,2200);\n})();\n\n/* ---------- countdown ---------- */\n(function(){\n  let target=new Date('2026-03-14T20:00:00Z').getTime();\n  const now=Date.now();\n  if(target<now){ target=now+ (11*24+7)*3600*1000; }\n  const p=n=>String(n).padStart(2,'0');\n  const el={d:document.getElementById('d'),h:document.getElementById('h'),m:document.getElementById('m'),s:document.getElementById('s')};\n  function tick(){\n    let t=Math.max(0,target-Date.now());\n    const dd=Math.floor(t/86400000); t-=dd*86400000;\n    const hh=Math.floor(t/3600000); t-=hh*3600000;\n    const mm=Math.floor(t/60000); t-=mm*60000;\n    const ss=Math.floor(t/1000);\n    el.d.textContent=p(dd);el.h.textContent=p(hh);el.m.textContent=p(mm);el.s.textContent=p(ss);\n  }\n  tick();setInterval(tick,1000);\n})();\n\n/* ---------- marquee ---------- */\n(function(){\n  const items=['$NFROG','<em>◆</em>','Zero tax','<em>◆</em>','LP burned','<em>◆</em>','Contract renounced','<em>◆</em>','Robinhood Chain','<em>◆</em>','1,000,000,000 supply','<em>◆</em>','Ribbit responsibly','<em>◆</em>'];\n  const line=items.map(i=>'<span>'+i+'</span>').join('');\n  document.getElementById('track').innerHTML=line+line+line+line;\n})();\n\n/* ---------- copy ---------- */\ndocument.getElementById('copyBtn').addEventListener('click',function(){\n  const t=document.getElementById('ca').textContent.trim();\n  const done=()=>{this.textContent='Copied ✓';setTimeout(()=>this.textContent='Copy',1600);};\n  if(navigator.clipboard){navigator.clipboard.writeText(t).then(done,done);}else{done();}\n});\n\n/* ---------- reveal + bars ---------- */\n(function(){\n  const io=new IntersectionObserver(es=>{\n    es.forEach(e=>{\n      if(e.isIntersecting){\n        e.target.classList.add('in');\n        e.target.querySelectorAll('.bar i').forEach(b=>{b.style.width=b.dataset.w+'%';});\n        io.unobserve(e.target);\n      }\n    });\n  },{threshold:.15});\n  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el=>io.observe(el));\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "at": 1790349389606}]}